.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt VMMANAGER.TOML 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vmmanager.toml
.Nd per-VM extras and state files of vmmanager
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr vmmanager 8
keeps what
.Xr vm.conf 5
cannot hold in two small TOML files, one string or boolean per line.
Nothing in them is read by
.Xr vmd 8 .
They are written by
.Xr vmmanager 8 ;
editing by hand is safe but not needed.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/vmmanager/<name>/vmmanager.toml
The extras of one VM.
.It Pa ~/vmmanager/state.toml
The state of the tool for one user.
.El
.Sh EXTRAS KEYS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic iso
Path of the install ISO, or an empty string when none is attached.
Cleared when the ISO is detached in update.
.It Ic os
Free-text OS label.
.It Ic notes
Free-text notes.
.It Ic created
Creation time, UTC, as
.Li YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ .
.It Ic version
The
.Xr vmmanager 8
version that created or migrated the VM.
.It Ic migrated_from
Written by migration: the old disk paths, separated by commas.
.El
.Sh STATE KEYS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic man_installed_version
The version of the man pages last installed system-wide.
The installation is offered again when it differs from the running version.
.It Ic man_declined
Set to
.Li true
when you answered no to installing the man pages.
The question is not asked again.
.Ic vmmanager \-\-install\-man
still works.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vm.conf 5 ,
.Xr vmmanager 8
